{
  "meta": {
    "title": "Kiro IDE and Kiro CLI — one agent harness",
    "subtitle": "IDE, CLI and Kiro Crew are front ends to the same standalone V3 harness, reached over ACP. Sources: kiro.dev/docs, Nov 2026",
    "review": false,
    "cost": {
      "note": "Kiro usage is billed as Kiro credits, not by the AWS account. The Amazon Bedrock line only illustrates where inference runs."
    }
  },
